<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-NatWest cuts ICI estimates.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NatWest cuts ICI estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Earnings estimates for Imperial Chemical Industries Plc and other British chemical companies were cut at NatWest Securities, reflecting the continued strength of sterling, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>For 1997, NatWest cut its pre-tax profit forecast for ICI to 430 million stg from 490 million. It repeated a &quot;hold&quot; rating on the stock.</p>
<p>ICI shares were down 6p at 797-1/2 by 1111 GMT in volume of 1.3 million shares.</p>
</text>
